{"id": "FT-TS1-E1", "version": 1, "type": "evidence", "tier": "candidate", "evidence_kind": "contract_conformance", "text": "tests/test_time_series.py: 19 tests pass (fail at collection on spec010 source). Full suite 222 -> 241 passed; core 214 -> 233 passed/8 optional skips. Periodic period-7 series: dominant lag 7, ACF > 0.9; white noise silent, 8/200 seeds flagged under the family-wise band; intermittent series zero share 2/3, ADI 3, longest zero run 2, CV2 1.71/5.3^2; constant undefined; 10 periods insufficient; 5 missing days vs 3 explicit zeros kept apart; by: top 3 of 6 groups with 18 other-group and 1 missing-key rows counted; scipy absent -> spectral not computed. Taxis: 32 days, 745 hours, 34 hours with no event (4.56%), daily ACF lag 7 0.1467775, hourly lag 24 0.5515768, 19 rows repeating a timestamp; pandas/numpy agree to 6 decimals. Separate-process JSON/HTML/Markdown byte-identical.", "method": "pytest; guide profile with PYTHONHASHSEED 1 and 99 and cmp; pandas resample('D'/'h').sum() and numpy ACF with the same estimator.", "limits": "One public real table and authored fixtures; thresholds and the family-wise rule are builder readings; no owner usefulness acceptance.", "relations": [{"rel": "supports", "to": "FT-TS1-C1@1"}, {"rel": "observed_on", "to": "code:tests.test_time_series.test_pure_periodic_series_peaks_at_its_period"}, {"rel": "observed_on", "to": "code:tests.test_time_series.test_white_noise_has_no_significant_structure"}, {"rel": "observed_on", "to": "code:tests.test_time_series.test_white_noise_family_wise_false_positive_rate_is_near_five_percent"}, {"rel": "observed_on", "to": "code:tests.test_time_series.test_intermittent_demand_frequency_amplitude_duration"}, {"rel": "observed_on", "to": "code:tests.test_time_series.test_constant_series_is_undefined_and_warned"}, {"rel": "observed_on", "to": "code:tests.test_time_series.test_short_series_is_insufficient"}, {"rel": "observed_on", "to": "code:tests.test_time_series.test_missing_periods_are_distinguished_from_explicit_zeros"}, {"rel": "observed_on", "to": "code:tests.test_time_series.test_event_counts_from_timestamps_with_hour_and_day"}, {"rel": "observed_on", "to": "code:tests.test_time_series.test_by_split_limits_to_top_n_groups"}, {"rel": "observed_on", "to": "code:tests.test_time_series.test_pacf_durbin_levinson_on_ar1_acf"}, {"rel": "observed_on", "to": "code:tests.test_time_series.test_spectral_degrades_without_scipy"}, {"rel": "observed_on", "to": "code:tests.test_time_series.test_report_has_temporal_section_with_stem_plots"}, {"rel": "observed_on", "to": "code:tests.test_time_series.test_undeclared_series_asks_one_question"}, {"rel": "observed_on", "to": "code:tests.test_time_series.test_decoys_stay_silent"}, {"rel": "observed_on", "to": "code:tests.test_time_series.test_invalid_declarations_are_refused"}]}
